Package: shinymui
Title: Material UI Components for Shiny via shinyreact
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti@gmail.com", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person(, "Posit Software, PBC", role = c("cph", "fnd"),
           comment = c(ROR = "03wc8by49"))
  )
Description: Material UI (MUI) components wired to Shiny's reactive system
    through shinyreact. Each helper returns a shinyreact node that renders a
    registered MUI React component, usable from 'app.R'.
